<li>National Academy of Sciences of the United States (1980)</li>
<li>American Academy of Arts and Sciences</li>
<li>American Society for Clinical Investigation</li>
<li>Association of American Physicians</li>
<li>American Society of Biological Chemists</li>
<li>American Society for Cell Biology</li>
